          "title": "**Ghost of Yotei** is getting a new story expansion and roguelike mode in October, plus a Complete Edition",
          "body": null,
          "url": "https://www.videogameschronicle.com/news/ghost-of-yotei-is-getting-a-new-story-expansion-and-roguelike-mode-in-october-plus-a-complete-edition/",
          "source": {
            "name": "VGC",
            "domain": "videogameschronicle.com"
          },
          "metadata": {
            "story_type": "confirmed",
            "importance": "normal"
          },
          "bullets": [
            "The new expansion is titled Echoes of Sekigahara, and will be available alongside a new combat survival mode called Most Wanted.",
            "Both modes will be released on October 1, and will be included together for $14.99 as DLC for players who already own Ghost of Yotei.",
            {
              "text": "For those who don’t own Ghosts of Yotei, a new Complete Edition of the game is available now. The DLC will arrive as a patch for the Complete Edition of the game on October 1st",
              "level": 1
            }
          ]
        },
